{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"还说不清\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他心里有股不肯停的劲，像是有事等着回应，却说不清等什么、为何不安，熟悉感又回来，过去也回不来了。\",\n      \"key\": \"不肯停的劲\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\", \"B3\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他还没缓过神，身体似乎先记得怎么往前，脑子却说不清该往哪走。\",\n      \"key\": \"身体先记得\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他不甘心任由事情照旧，怕那样就等于承认眼下的一切本来就该如此，也怕真投进去会失去别的东西，想停又逼自己撑住。\",\n      \"key\": \"本来就该如此\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B5\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他想找理由往前走，每次快要想通，舍不得又回来，连刚有的确信也陌生了，他仍说不清舍不得什么。\",\n      \"key\": \"舍不得又回来\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他为自己总要先想透才肯动而难堪。\",\n      \"key\": \"想透才肯动\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R2\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S01-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"将「认了只能这样」恢复为「承认眼下的一切本来就该如此」，保留任由现状照旧所包含的正当化意味，同时不改变他害怕投入后失去东西、又逼自己撑住的两难。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ceba5537-634f-4192-a7c3-ccb31381b18a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T003700076655Z", "elapsed_seconds": 37.312, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T00:37:37.397084+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_v